{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43621","headline":"建安寺西院喜王郎中遘恩命初至联句 · 清昼","name":"建安寺西院喜王郎中遘恩命初至联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迹就空门退，官从画省迁。\n住持良有愿，朝谒宂无缘。\n身净金绳内，心驰玉扆前。\n荣添一两日，恩降九霄年。\n慕法能轻冕，追非欲佩弦。\n栖闲那可久，鸳鹭待行联。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清昼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43621.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43621","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}